{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/fffe0d593305c22d9ab7184428bb21db.avif?t=1771058931\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras_big/fffe0d593305c22d9ab7184428bb21db.webp?t=1771058931 width=1560 height=501 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A brutal, cinematic action-adventure where trauma and revenge collide.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> In Ramirtana, even gods whisper in the shadows.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/1209d12968a363b50c204e5f9911177c.poster.avif?t=1771058931\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/1209d12968a363b50c204e5f9911177c.webm?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/1209d12968a363b50c204e5f9911177c.mp4?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/4da1220dbac0321c6004b4c52429c6d2.poster.avif?t=1771058931\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/4da1220dbac0321c6004b4c52429c6d2.webm?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/4da1220dbac0321c6004b4c52429c6d2.mp4?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/799f25924fd7d96786aaedf2d95fa262.poster.avif?t=1771058931\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/799f25924fd7d96786aaedf2d95fa262.webm?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/799f25924fd7d96786aaedf2d95fa262.mp4?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/00a2f97b58582b9c23d6b756cc588726.poster.avif?t=1771058931\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/00a2f97b58582b9c23d6b756cc588726.webm?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/00a2f97b58582b9c23d6b756cc588726.mp4?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/4779ae4a78cce19da48d6535c46cd134.poster.avif?t=1771058931\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/4779ae4a78cce19da48d6535c46cd134.webm?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/4779ae4a78cce19da48d6535c46cd134.mp4?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/5298fc805e5f3597f0fad4720d180c09.poster.avif?t=1771058931\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/5298fc805e5f3597f0fad4720d180c09.webm?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/5298fc805e5f3597f0fad4720d180c09.mp4?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/764108e9e7c14982cead19f8d7b423bf.poster.avif?t=1771058931\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/764108e9e7c14982cead19f8d7b423bf.webm?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/764108e9e7c14982cead19f8d7b423bf.mp4?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/e6cecd7958ee4768378720ceed09e062.poster.avif?t=1771058931\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/e6cecd7958ee4768378720ceed09e062.webm?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/e6cecd7958ee4768378720ceed09e062.mp4?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the relentless world of <strong>Firva: Strings of Fate</strong>, where you control the action but not the destiny. Play as Firva, a mute warrior bound by an inescapable fate. Experience a gripping narrative told through the eyes of three different narrators, each revealing new perspectives as you carve your way through fast-paced, visceral combat and confront the inevitable. The fixed camera forces you to witness every twist, turn, and tragic decision, every choice already made, creating a truly cinematic journey. You can\u2019t change the outcome, but you\u2019ll feel every moment of Firva\u2019s dark destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the richly imagined world of <strong>Ramirtana</strong>, the game follows Firva, a survivor haunted by loss, as she seeks to reclaim a mysterious ancestral bow tied to her bloodline. As ancient powers awaken, Firva is caught between memory, myth, and monstrosity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Narrative Premise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a poetic saga of revenge set in a mythic realm shaped by memory, trauma, and divine manipulation. <strong>Firva: Strings of Fate</strong> is a deeply personal character study, blending action and cinematic storytelling with multiple narrators, environmental storytelling, and a haunting soundtrack. Every element works together to immerse you in Firva\u2019s tragic mythology.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Firva: Strings of Fate, every encounter is a tense, cinematic confrontation that demands precision, agility, and instant reflexes. Aggressive combos, chained parries, and split-second dashes are your only means of survival against relentless enemies with distinct behaviors and no tolerance for mistakes. Mistiming even a single move can lead to heavy punishment. The combat system is built around full player control and requires sharp coordination of mind and muscle. This intensity reaches its peak in a climactic boss fight that not only tests your agility and timing, but also challenges your perception through psychological layers woven deep into the encounter\u2014making victory feel truly hard-earned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Join our Discord to get the latest news &amp; updates about the game:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link In Social Media Section<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Gameplay</strong>: No control over the camera, immerse yourself in a film-like experience where every moment is carefully crafted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Narrative</strong>: Unravel mythological and psychological layers across multiple chapters, each with unique narrative twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles &amp; Exploration</strong>: Discover diverse biomes, haunting ruins, and cryptic paths filled with secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotionally Charged Boss Fights</strong>: High-stakes, story-driven duels with lasting consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Storytelling</strong>: Emotional cutscenes and dynamic narration offer new perspectives on every playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visceral Combat</strong>: Master a challenging system of combos, dodges, and parries for satisfying skill-based battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Traversal</strong>: Navigate the world by climbing, grabbing edges, and exploring intricate structures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re ready to dive into a narrative-driven action adventure where fate is inevitable but the journey is unforgettable,\u00a0<strong>Firva: Strings of Fate</strong> awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2657340?t=1771058931","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/68f5696b8a402f178ebdfc43afb94d8b40188465/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771058931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/590e66ab9ba4c49a044923c9ecf1a610b24795c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771058931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/590e66ab9ba4c49a044923c9ecf1a610b24795c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771058931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game includes scenes depicting torture, mutilated and burnt bodies, as well as graphic depictions of blood and gore."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Free Steam Key</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join our Play Test and score a free Steam key at launch!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be part of our Play Test and you\u2019ll receive a free Steam key once the game officially releases. Just make sure to complete the Play Test form so we can send your key straight to your inbox on release day.</p></p><br><h1>Just Updated</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Changelog \u2013 Fight Prototype v0.26.5.9.02</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finisher Move</strong>: Added a new finisher mechanic to the game, allowing for more impactful combat sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial</strong>: Introduced a tutorial to guide players through core mechanics and gameplay basics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visuals &amp; Effects</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Placeholder VFX</strong>: Basic visual effects have been implemented to enhance fight sequences (to be refined in future updates).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera Shake</strong>: Added camera shake feedback on player attacks to improve immersion.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/fffe0d593305c22d9ab7184428bb21db.avif?t=1771058931\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras_big/fffe0d593305c22d9ab7184428bb21db.webp?t=1771058931 width=1560 height=501 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A brutal, cinematic action-adventure where trauma and revenge collide.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> In Ramirtana, even gods whisper in the shadows.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/1209d12968a363b50c204e5f9911177c.poster.avif?t=1771058931\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/1209d12968a363b50c204e5f9911177c.webm?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/1209d12968a363b50c204e5f9911177c.mp4?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/4da1220dbac0321c6004b4c52429c6d2.poster.avif?t=1771058931\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/4da1220dbac0321c6004b4c52429c6d2.webm?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/4da1220dbac0321c6004b4c52429c6d2.mp4?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/799f25924fd7d96786aaedf2d95fa262.poster.avif?t=1771058931\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/799f25924fd7d96786aaedf2d95fa262.webm?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/799f25924fd7d96786aaedf2d95fa262.mp4?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/00a2f97b58582b9c23d6b756cc588726.poster.avif?t=1771058931\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/00a2f97b58582b9c23d6b756cc588726.webm?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/00a2f97b58582b9c23d6b756cc588726.mp4