ource src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/764108e9e7c14982cead19f8d7b423bf.mp4?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/e6cecd7958ee4768378720ceed09e062.poster.avif?t=1771058931\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/e6cecd7958ee4768378720ceed09e062.webm?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/extras/e6cecd7958ee4768378720ceed09e062.mp4?t=1771058931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the relentless world of <strong>Firva: Strings of Fate</strong>, where you control the action but not the destiny. Play as Firva, a mute warrior bound by an inescapable fate. Experience a gripping narrative told through the eyes of three different narrators, each revealing new perspectives as you carve your way through fast-paced, visceral combat and confront the inevitable. The fixed camera forces you to witness every twist, turn, and tragic decision, every choice already made, creating a truly cinematic journey. You can\u2019t change the outcome, but you\u2019ll feel every moment of Firva\u2019s dark destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the richly imagined world of <strong>Ramirtana</strong>, the game follows Firva, a survivor haunted by loss, as she seeks to reclaim a mysterious ancestral bow tied to her bloodline. As ancient powers awaken, Firva is caught between memory, myth, and monstrosity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Narrative Premise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a poetic saga of revenge set in a mythic realm shaped by memory, trauma, and divine manipulation. <strong>Firva: Strings of Fate</strong> is a deeply personal character study, blending action and cinematic storytelling with multiple narrators, environmental storytelling, and a haunting soundtrack. Every element works together to immerse you in Firva\u2019s tragic mythology.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Firva: Strings of Fate, every encounter is a tense, cinematic confrontation that demands precision, agility, and instant reflexes. Aggressive combos, chained parries, and split-second dashes are your only means of survival against relentless enemies with distinct behaviors and no tolerance for mistakes. Mistiming even a single move can lead to heavy punishment. The combat system is built around full player control and requires sharp coordination of mind and muscle. This intensity reaches its peak in a climactic boss fight that not only tests your agility and timing, but also challenges your perception through psychological layers woven deep into the encounter\u2014making victory feel truly hard-earned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Join our Discord to get the latest news &amp; updates about the game:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link In Social Media Section<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Gameplay</strong>: No control over the camera, immerse yourself in a film-like experience where every moment is carefully crafted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Narrative</strong>: Unravel mythological and psychological layers across multiple chapters, each with unique narrative twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles &amp; Exploration</strong>: Discover diverse biomes, haunting ruins, and cryptic paths filled with secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotionally Charged Boss Fights</strong>: High-stakes, story-driven duels with lasting consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Storytelling</strong>: Emotional cutscenes and dynamic narration offer new perspectives on every playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visceral Combat</strong>: Master a challenging system of combos, dodges, and parries for satisfying skill-based battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Traversal</strong>: Navigate the world by climbing, grabbing edges, and exploring intricate structures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re ready to dive into a narrative-driven action adventure where fate is inevitable but the journey is unforgettable,\u00a0<strong>Firva: Strings of Fate</strong> awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["DoneGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657340/b05104ffe89039d31cdeef83d1d698542ef0ffb5/header.jpg?t=1771058931","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Firva Strings of Fate","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7600 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li>